58#issuecomment-5917018580","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123958","id":5917018580,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYK6J1A","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T18:12:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T14:25:11Z","body":"Some Find in Files issues:\n- Replacing occurrences on the same line one at a time does not work correctly, the columns don't get updated right.\n- If a replace fails there is no error, it just prints to verbose output. If it fails, the user should know.\n\nReliability:\n- `lookup_code` only works if the script is validated, so if the search happens on changes before it is validated, they will not be pre-checked correctly. Its easier to reproduce if `text_editor/completion/idle_parse_delay` is long (and we may allow disabling it in the future).\n- If there is an error in the script, `lookup_code` doesn't work correctly until the script is saved.\n- There is no mention about no undo redo support.\n- The new name does not have to be a valid identifier (it supports spaces and other characters).","author_association":"CONTRIBU